### 博主登录（正确身份）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"blogger01","password":"123456","role":"blogger"}

### 客服登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"service01","password":"123456","role":"service"}

### 查询博主主页
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile

### 反例：博主账号选管理员身份（应返回 401 身份不符）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"blogger01","password":"123456","role":"admin"}

### 反例：密码错误（应返回 401 账号或密码错误）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"user01","password":"000000","role":"user"}
